*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0011
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 469
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0011.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FRD0011C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 RISK-GRADE         PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    *> FRAUD RISK SCORE
    05 RISK-SCORE         PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM RATE-ACTIVITY
    DISPLAY "RISK-GRADE=" RISK-GRADE
    DISPLAY "RISK-SCORE=" RISK-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
RATE-ACTIVITY.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> VERY HIGH TRANSACTION VELOCITY - LIMIT 30 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN TXN-COUNT-24H > 20 AND TXN-AMT > 3000
            MOVE 'H' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 90 TO RISK-SCORE
        *> ELEVATED TRANSACTION VELOCITY - LIMIT 6 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN TXN-COUNT-24H > 8
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 60 TO RISK-SCORE
        *> ACTIVITY ON NEW ACCOUNT - LIMIT 90 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN ACCT-AGE-DAYS < 60
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 40 TO RISK-SCORE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'L' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 10 TO RISK-SCORE
    END-EVALUATE.
